{"arrivo":"ar","origine":"ota","origine_nome":"Ottoman Turkish","livello2":"fa-cls","livello2_nome":"Classical Persian","n":6,"parole":[{"parola":"بشكير","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"towel","termine_origine":"پیشكیر","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"پیشكیر","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"پیشگیر","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"fa-cls","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Ottoman Turkish پیشكیر, from Classical Persian پیشگیر (pēšgīr)."},{"parola":"تكية","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"Sufi lodge, used for praying and other religious ceremonies, also used as a hostel for wanderers; takya","termine_origine":"تَكیه","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"تَكیه","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"تَکْیَه","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"fa-cls","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Ottoman Turkish تَكیه (tekye), from Classical Persian تَکْیَه (takya), Arabicized as if it were from root ت ك ي (t k y) using the pattern فَعِيلَة (faʕīla) with plural فَعَالَى (faʕālā) (like هَدِيَّة (hadiyya), plural هَدَايَا (hadāyā))."},{"parola":"طرشي","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"pickle, vegetable made to last with vinegar or salt","termine_origine":"ترشی","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"ترشی","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"تُرْشِی","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"fa-cls","ambiti":["cucina"],"via":"","testo":"From Ottoman Turkish ترشی (turşı, turşu)."},{"parola":"طواية","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":2,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"frying pan","termine_origine":"تاوه ,طاوه","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"تاوه ,طاوه","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"تاوه","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"pal","nome":"Middle Persian","termine":"tʾp̄k'","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"pal","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Ottoman Turkish تاوه , طاوه (tava, “frying pan”), from Classical Persian تاوه (tāva), from Middle Persian tʾp̄k' (tābag), whence also طَابَق (ṭābaq). See also Hijazi Arabic طاوة (ṭāwa, “frying pan”) and Moroccan Arabic طاوة (ṭāwa, “cooking pot”) – apparently the present form is from Levantine d"},{"parola":"كتابخانة","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"library; bookstore","termine_origine":"کتابخانه\n","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"کتابخانه\n","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"کِتَابْخَانَه","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"fa-cls","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Ottoman Turkish کتابخانه (kitabhane), borrowed from Classical Persian کِتَابْخَانَه (kitābxāna), from کتاب (ketâb) + خانه (xâne, “house”). By surface analysis, كِتَاب (kitāb) + خَانَة (ḵāna)."},{"parola":"كشك","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"kiosk, booth","termine_origine":"كوشك","catena":[{"codice":"ota","nome":"Ottoman Turkish","termine":"كوشك","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"fa-cls","nome":"Classical Persian","termine":"کوشْک","categoria":"prestito"},{"codice":"pal","nome":"Middle Persian","termine":"kwšk'","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"pal","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Ottoman Turkish كوشك (köşk)."}]}